{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333330/extras/6aa309b1a8062658d94baba6f2de5405.poster.avif?t=1757428561\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333330/extras/6aa309b1a8062658d94baba6f2de5405.webm?t=1757428561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333330/extras/6aa309b1a8062658d94baba6f2de5405.mp4?t=1757428561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Programming puzzle game, but YOU CAN'T TYPE. Navigate and run pre-existing lines of code to make your output match the goal! Watch out for bugs eating away your code! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level of You Are The Code consists of prewritten code. You get to choose which lines to run in order to match the desired output. Each time you move up or down a line, the bugs will advance and try to erase your code! In some cases, maybe that's not such a bad thing...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Placed in the top 2% of the GMTK 2023 Game Jam out of 6700 entries!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to understand custom programming language, no prior programming knowledge required</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move undo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time based puzzles, nothing happens unless you make a move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to add custom levels (requires your own text editor)</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Gem","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3333330/f5a2e20855f5d9981768e25a7b5f87cbf0c913b6.jpg"},{"name":"More Than Just Gems","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3333330/e12f2ce27756607a5dcc397772a9541d8e3304fc.jpg"},{"name":"Infinite Loop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3333330/e188753b8d1e43dd294128fe9aa59153bd8eff98.jpg"},{"name":"Max Folder Depth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3333330/a026c46db7b74fc3bac0afe22c84e1d059222150.jpg"},{"name":"More Than Just Numbers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3333330/8cde802cc5f39b877e2db4d546b2b23f5c9d1c92.jpg"},{"name":"Division By Zero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3333330/29e83221a9fe58463fac16ee84e99192383e509f.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3333330?t=1757428561","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3333330?t=1757428561","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333330/fb612679a969464b9f02dcfa797c38ba6dde10ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757428561","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333330/fb612679a969464b9f02dcfa797c38ba6dde10ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757428561","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3628770,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333330/extras/6aa309b1a8062658d94baba6f2de5405.poster.avif?t=1757428561\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333330/extras/6aa309b1a8062658d94baba6f2de5405.webm?t=1757428561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333330/extras/6aa309b1a8062658d94baba6f2de5405.mp4?t=1757428561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Programming puzzle game, but YOU CAN'T TYPE. Navigate and run pre-existing lines of code to make your output match the goal! Watch out for bugs eating away your code! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level of You Are The Code consists of prewritten code. You get to choose which lines to run in order to match the desired output. Each time you move up or down a line, the bugs will advance and try to erase your code! In some cases, maybe that's not such a bad thing...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Placed in the top 2% of the GMTK 2023 Game Jam out of 6700 entries!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to understand custom programming language, no prior programming knowledge required</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move undo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time based puzzles, nothing happens unless you make a move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to add custom levels (requires your own text editor)</p></li></ul>","developers":["ThinkWithGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333330/e6b47e4aa8a467f7126ca8be0eec87ba97cb1ac1/header.jpg?t=1757428561","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257187471,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187471/movie480.mp4?t=1755917954","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187471/movie_max.mp4?t=1755917954"},"name":"August2025Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257187471/1b2730be2a9daf1047f3547e8190a6d9460a3038/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755917954","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187471/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755917954","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187471/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1755917954"}}],"name":"You Are The Code","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"You Are The Code - $9.99 USD","packageid":1180030,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":999}],"title":"Buy You Are The Code"}],"packages":[1180030],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.8 Ghz Processor<br></li><li><